ACTION_IF GAME_IS ~bgt~ AND FILE_EXISTS ~Paladins-of-Faerun/Worldmap/links.tbl~ BEGIN
			PRINT ~Link between Aeras for BGT~
	COPY_EXISTING ~Paladins-of-Faerun/Worldmap/links.tbl~ ~weidu_external/Paladins-of-Faerun/Worldmap/links.tbl~
